---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import profileImg from "../../public/assets/profile.jpg";
---

<BaseLayout title="Personal Statement | Shubham Thakur">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto my-12 font-serif px-4">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <a href="/" class="link-back"> ← Back </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-2 order-2 md:order-1">
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed text-justify mb-5">
          Hi, I'm Shubham. Currently, I am a final year CS Undergrad student. I
          love to spend my time thinking about, understanding, and working on
          systems. In addition to this, I fancy literature, art, and music.
          Within me, I carry a whim to become a Poet as well.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed text-justify mb-8">
          Since childhood, I've found myself drawn towards a huge array of
          things. Lately, it has began to come sense out of all this chaos — I
          have realized that I want to be a polymath. Consequently, produce
          something of personal and societal meaning. For now, I want to deepen
          my knowledge of building intelligent, reliable, and secure systems.
          This is for the reason that computer science has become a bedrock of
          every modern change and a deep expertise in building CS solutions is
          of paramount importance.
        </p>

        <div>
          <a
            href="/assets/shbhmt.pdf"
            class="btn btn-secondary inline-block text-base"
            target="_blank"
            download
          >
            See Curriculum Vitae
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="md:col-span-1 order-1 md:order-2 flex justify-center md:justify-end"
      >
        <Image
          src={profileImg}
          alt="Shubham Thakur"
          class="w-64 h-64 rounded-lg object-cover border border-[#2D3033]"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
